OL,3,AWiddecombe suspect had 'particular
OL,4,Ahostility to Reform', court told
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe man accused of murdering Ann
OL,7,FWiddecombe had a "particular hostility
OL,8,Fto Reform", prosecutors alleged on
OL,9,FFriday.
OL,11,FThey said Joshua Kerry, 28, "had an
OL,12,Fextreme left wing and/or
OL,13,Fanti-establishment mindset".
OL,15,FThe prosecution also told the Old
OL,16,FBailey Widdecombe's murder had a
OL,17,F"terrorist connection" as it was
OL,18,F"politically and ideologically
OL,19,Fmotivated".
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
